#OBSD
>> dirname := [''].
{ dirname ongeza-mwishoni: ['X/']. } * (1024 / 2 - 4).
>> command := ['mkdir -p /tmp/'] + dirname.
Programu mfumo: command.
Programu chdir: ['/tmp/'] + dirname.
>> filename := [''].
{ filename ongeza-mwishoni: ['YYYYYYYY']. } * 20.
Faili mpya: filename, andika: ['sometext'].
{ Faili orodha: ['/tmp/'] + dirname. } * 1000.
Towe andika: ['no crash'], mstari-mpya.

